# - LR-MACE (local split-charge MACE with predicted multipoles) is mapped to MACE, as for the self-consistent electrostatic MACE variants of baldwin2026; registry decision pending.
# - Table S8 lists 24 Cu-water model variants (AIMD versions 1-3 and ITERATIVE, 2-4 layers, L = 0/1); only two ITERATIVE models are encoded. The BPNNP of Ref. 63 (Table S5) and the TiO2-water BPNNPs of Ref. 95 are literature models.
# - Foundation models are compared only through dipole distributions (Fig. S2); MACE-MATPES-PBE and MACE-MH-1 are paper-local runs because no registry model exists.
# - Dipole distributions, band gaps, PDoS and autocorrelation functions are property analyses.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/parker2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

